@startuml SD-08
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-08 / UC-08 - View and filter all reservations
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Staff as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Request all reservations, a status filter or one reference
alt non-staff identity or unsupported status
system --> actor: Reject request with a clear reason
else staff and supported filter
note right of system
All includes all three statuses. A specific
filter returns only that status. Read stored
reservation amounts.
end note
alt matching records found
system --> actor: Show reference, customer, title, quantity, saved amount\nand status
else matching list empty
system --> actor: Show explicit empty-results message
else selected reference missing or read fails
system --> actor: Show not-found or read error
end
end
note right of system
Read-only goal. Offer UC-06 only for eligible
pending records; no staff cancellation,
arbitrary edits or date-range analytics.
end note
@enduml
